        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: U.S. Forest Service, National Park Service\n- Places: Croatan National Forest, Nantahala National Forest, Uwharrie National Forest, Art Loeb Trail\n- Systems: National forests, park administration\n\nFacts:\n- The Art Loeb Trail runs through a park administered by the same people who administer Croatan National Forest, Nantahala National Forest, and Uwharrie National Forest.\n- Croatan National Forest, Nantahala National Forest, and Uwharrie National Forest are three other national forests administered by that same administration.",
